message: "If you use this skill, please cite it as below."
title: "Ecosystem Digital Twin — Agent Skill"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Baldanova
    given-names: Rigjita
version: "2.2"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rigjite/Ecosystem-Digital-Twin"
abstract: >-
  An Agent Skill for designing, building, auditing, and reporting digital
  twins of ecosystems (ponds and lakes, river reaches, farmland, air basins,
  conservation sites), with standard-library Python scripts that enforce its
  rules: data quality gate, trend tests, calibration against naive baselines,
  alert bands, uncertainty budgets, a pre-registered forecast registry,
  sensitive-species coordinate generalization, and RO-Crate 1.1 provenance
  packages.
keywords:
  - agent-skill
  - digital-twin
  - ecology
  - environmental-monitoring
  - water-quality
  - ecological-forecasting
  - ro-crate
